  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Luxury at its finest! Meticulously appointed, spacious 2-story home featuring 4 large bedrooms plus a versatile 2nd living area that doubles as a 5th bedroom. Enjoy an open-concept design with a gourmet kitchen, a large laundry room, and a screened-in patio. This home also includes a garage, a golf cart, 2 adult bikes, and access to a community pool. Perfect for comfortable living and entertaining!<br><br>Wavecrest Retreat – A Luxurious Coastal Escape<br><br>Welcome to Wavecrest Retreat, a stunning two-story vacation home designed for comfort, elegance, and convenience. Nestled in the heart of Inlet Beach, this beautifully decorated retreat is just minutes from the pristine beaches of the Emerald Coast and the charming town of Rosemary Beach.<br><br>Property Highlights:<br><br> - 4 Spacious Bedrooms – Featuring king and queen beds, each with a private en-suite bathroom for ultimate privacy and relaxation.<br> - 2nd Living Area/5th Bedroom – Includes a sleeper couch, perfect for extra guests.<br> - 2 Half Bathrooms – Conveniently located for guests.<br> - Open-Concept Living – Designed with stylish decor and high-end furnishings.<br> - Gourmet Kitchen – Fully equipped with modern luxury, including a gas range, oversized island seating for 3, and a spacious dining area that seats 8.<br> - Screened-In Patio – Provides an additional dining space for outdoor meals.<br> - Community Pool – Gated for relaxation and family fun.<br> - Garage & Golf Cart – Included for easy beach access and exploring the area.<br> - Prime Location – Close to boutique shopping, world-class dining, and entertainment.<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements:<br><br> - Suite 1 – King bed with ensuite bathroom.<br> - Suite 2 – King bed with ensuite bathroom.<br> - Suite 3 –King bed with ensuite bathroom.<br> - Suite 4 – King Bunks with ensuite bathroom and Trundle<br> - 2nd Living Area – Pull-out couch sleeps 2, making it a perfect 5th bedroom.<br><br>Local Dining Favorites:<br><br> - Pescado – Upscale seafood with beach views and live music.<br> - Restaurant Paradis – Exquisite fine dining experience.<br> - Edward's Fine Foods – A culinary gem in Rosemary Beach.<br> - Cuvee 30A – Gourmet cuisine with an extensive wine selection.<br> - Amici Restaurant – Authentic Italian pasta perfection.<br> - Aja Elevated Asian – A must-try for Asian cuisine lovers.<br> - George's & The Citizen – Premier dining spots in Alys Beach.<br> - Shunk Gully – A Gulf Place favorite with fresh seafood and live music.<br> - Shades – Casual bar and grill, perfect for watching the game.<br> - PCB Favorites – Saltwater Grill, Firefly, and Billy's are worth the short drive!<br><br>Fun 30A Activities:<br><br> - Rent bikes to explore scenic paths.<br> - Kayak or paddleboard in the emerald waters.<br> - Hike trails at nearby state parks.<br> - Enjoy live music at local venues.<br> - Snorkel or paddleboard at manmade reefs.<br> - Visit the 30A Farmers' Market on Sundays.<br> - Play tennis at the Rosemary Racket Club.<br> - Experience pickleball and sports fields at Frank Brown Park and South Walton Sports Complex.<br><br>Nearby Attractions:<br><br> - Rosemary Beach – Quaint village with boutique shops and fine dining.<br> - Alys Beach – Elegant architecture and luxurious experiences.<br> - The Hub at WaterSound Beach – Family-friendly entertainment hub.<br> - Coastal Dune Lakes – Unique natural wonders for kayaking and paddleboarding.<br> - Timpoochee Trail – Scenic biking path along 30A.<br> - Grayton Beach State Park & Topsail Hill Preserve – Pristine beaches and nature trails.<br> - Eden Gardens State Park – A historic mansion with stunning gardens.<br> - Destin Favorites – HarborWalk Village, Big Kahuna's Water Park, and Destin Commons for family fun and Crab Island.<br><br>The Experience:<br><br>Whether you're lounging by the pool, savoring the sunset from the patio, or enjoying a day at the beach, Wavecrest Retreat is the perfect blend of tranquility and convenience. With its serene coastal design and modern amenities, this home is an ideal destination for creating lasting memories with family and friends.<br><br> - Guest Access & Additional Information:<br> - Guests have full access to the property, including the pool, yard, and beach access.<br> - The property manager is available for recommendations and assistance.<br> - The home features two separate living quarters, connected via a screened-in, covered stairway – perfect for large groups seeking both togetherness and privacy.<br> - Book your stay today and experience the best of coastal living on 30A!<br> - Enjoy the entire home and the community pool<br> - Feel free to reach out to our team with any questions or recommendations on fun activities<br><br>Enjoy Your Stay!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
